# UI

Minimal. Whitespace, one accent (the primary token), hairline borders, no heavy shadows.

Desktop: filter sidebar, job list, detail pane. On mobile the sidebar collapses into a Sheet, and a job opens as its own page.

A job row shows a logo or initial, title, company, location, remote badge, posted-ago, source badge, and save. The match score chip appears only on For you.

Use shadcn Command, Select, Checkbox, Badge, Sheet, Tabs, Skeleton, Sonner, and Dialog. "/" focuses search. Arrow keys move through the list.

Every list has a skeleton, an empty state, and an error state.

Place `<AdSlot />` in the sidebar and between list items. It renders nothing until ads are added.
